<title>JAPAN: Yahagi bid-only after Kyokuichi takeover bid.</title>
<headline>Yahagi bid-only after Kyokuichi takeover bid.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yahagi Iron Co Ltd's shares were bid-only in the Friday morning session after Kyokuichi Corp said it would to make a friendly takeover bid for Yahagi Iron as part of a broad tie-up, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0101 GMT, Yahagi's shares were bid-only after closing at 292 yen on the previous day.</p>
<p>Entertainment company Kyokuichi's shares were up 80 yen to 1,280.</p>
